###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#Beginner
:Beginner rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                   :ProficiencyLevel ;
          :levelValue 2 ;
          rdfs:comment """Description: The individual has a basic understanding and can perform simple tasks with some support. They are beginning to apply knowledge and skills in familiar contexts.
Characteristics: Can perform routine tasks, follows structured processes, and requires occasional assistance.
Example: A student who can write simple programs and debug basic errors with some help from a teacher or peers.""" ;
          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "NP2" .


