                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Demonstrate the SDLC phases and activities by understanding project definition and attributes, cost-benefit analysis, economic feasibility, business requirement documentation, organizational feasibility, risk management and its role in the project management, systems migration plan, systems maintenance program, IT infrastructure design, and terminating a project; applying systems request, project management plan, responsibility assignment matrix, functional and non-functional requirements, requirement elicitation techniques, root cause analysis, work schedule and critical path, testing plan for performance and security, deployment plan, system maintenance plan, and change request document; evaluating technical and software requirement specifications, technical feasibility, and work breakdown structure; and creating use cases, user interfaces, data models and entity relationship diagrams (ERDs), process modeling diagrams, data flow diagrams, and database creation." .


