                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Apply fundamental elements of objects and classes by modeling the properties of an entity using data types and variables within a class definition, modeling behaviors using procedures within a class definition, understanding the distinction between instance and class members, and applying these concepts within a class definition." .


