###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.5_C8_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.5_C8_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Demonstrate mobile user interface design and the user experience by applying a seamless experience across multiple devices, applying end user personalization of the app, creating mobile application layouts, and applying best practices." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.5_C8_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.5_C8_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Demonstrate mobile user interface design and the user experience" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.5_C9_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.5_C9_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Implement cyber security measures for a mobile application by understanding security issues (i.e., app store security, malware, IoT hardware, etc.), applying authentication, understanding encryption and decryption, and creating mobile application data encryption and decryption." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.5_C9_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.5_C9_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Implement cyber security measures for a mobile application" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C1_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C1_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Apply principles of user-Centered design (UCD) by understanding users, tasks, and environments, gathering user feedback to define requirements and design, involving users in the design process, implementing an iterative user design process, understanding essential elements of user centered design, and understanding human capabilities that motivate them, including motor skills, attention, and human error." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C1_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C1_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Apply principles of user-Centered design (UCD)" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C2_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C2_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Apply user-system interaction principles by understanding direct manipulation objects of interest in the UI that are visible and can be acted upon, menu based systems where users work their way through a series of screens or menus, form fill-in where a user needs to enter the necessary information in order to complete a specific task for requirement, command line interaction with operating systems, and natural language allowing a user to interact with the computer using a human language." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C2_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C2_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Apply user-system interaction principles" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C3_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C3_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Design and create effective user-centered user interaction with an application by creating navigation enabling users to easily accomplish tasks, creating intuitive forms for gathering required data, creating a working application or web page template for various devices using mobile-first design principles, identifying an application’s target audience and creating an audience-appropriate design, and using critical thinking skills to revise the application based on feedback." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C3_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C3_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Design and create effective user-centered user interaction with an application" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C4_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C4_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify and evaluate attributes of effective UX by evaluating perception, simplicity, clarity, consistency, hierarchy (visual and temporal), creating a personalized experience, creating and aligning the information architecture of the application environment to support usability, comprehensibility, and search, applying familiarity with human-computer interface principles and issues, and creating and implementing user testing strategies to include usability testing, A/B testing, and user flow validation." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C4_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C4_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Identify and evaluate attributes of effective UX" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C5_Description
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C5_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Evaluate the influence user centered design has on user experience (UX) by applying cooperative and participatory design, understanding UX purpose, audience, context, and history, applying analysis tools and techniques such as Personas, Scenarios, Use Cases, User Stories, Storyboards, and Wireframes, and understanding underlying philosophies such as action-orientation, design thinking, human-centrism, information architecture, and socio-technical perspectives." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.4.6_C5_Title
:LS_IS_A3.4.6_C5_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Evaluate the Influence of User-Centered Design on User Experience (UX)" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C1_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C1_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Demonstrate ethical behavior during data collection by understanding international, country-specific, state, and local laws and regulations governing the collection of data, how data is collected via various mediums (mobile devices, websites, social media, email, wearable devices), common ethical philosophical frameworks, and basic principles governing ethical decision making." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C1_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C1_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Demonstrate ethical behavior during data collection" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C2_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C2_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify the moral issues that surround the storage and usage of data by applying data storage and codes of ethics, evaluating decision making for sharing and using data, and understanding moral codes for data sharing." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C2_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C2_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Identify the moral issues that surround the storage and usage of data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C3_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C3_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Examine ethical philosophies and their practical application by analyzing ethical philosophies, applying computing practices surrounding data sharing and security, applying vocabulary, and analyzing best practices." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C3_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C3_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Examine ethical philosophies and their practical application" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C4_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C4_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Investigate ethical codes of practice and their implications for society by applying IS ethical code of conduct, understanding the importance of an ethical code of conduct, applying critical elements of an ethical code of conduct, applying and adhering to ethical code of conduct, evaluating breaches of ethical codes of conduct, and analyzing legal aspects of ethical conduct." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C4_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C4_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Investigate ethical codes of practice and their implications for society" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C5_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C5_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify aspects of sustainability and adaptive systems and data by understanding the sustainability and adaptability of systems, and analyzing legal issues surrounding reusing data collected for another purpose." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C5_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C5_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Identify aspects of sustainability and adaptive systems and data" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C6_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C6_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Categorize ethical stakeholders and their importance to Information Systems by applying knowledge of core IS stakeholders, IS stakeholder roles, and evaluating their implications for IS." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C6_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C6_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Categorize ethical stakeholders and their importance to Information Systems" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C7_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C7_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support organizations by applying processes, activities, and performance criteria to support ethical behavior in organizations." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C7_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C7_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support organizations" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C8_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C8_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support the individual by applying processes, activities, and performance criteria to support ethical behavior for the individual." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C8_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C8_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support the individual" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C9_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C9_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support society at large by applying processes, activities, and performance criteria to support ethical behavior by society." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.1_C9_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.1_C9_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Investigate sustainable processes, actions, and performance to support society at large" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C10_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C10_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       :LangString ;
                              :language "en" ;
                              :string "Apply leading service management frameworks, such as ITIL and CMMI by applying knowledge of IT Infrastructure Library (ITIL) and Capability Maturity Model Integration (CMMI)." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C10_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C10_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                 :LangString ;
                        :language "en" ;
                        :string "Apply leading service management frameworks, such as ITIL and CMMI" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C11_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C11_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       :LangString ;
                              :language "en" ;
                              :string "Identify commonly used governance frameworks, such as COBIT and TOGAF, to align IS with organizational requirements by applying knowledge of Control Objectives for Information and Related Technologies (COBIT) and Open Group Architecture Framework (TOGAF)." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C11_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C11_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                 :LangString ;
                        :language "en" ;
                        :string "Identify commonly used governance frameworks, such as COBIT and TOGAF, to align IS with organizational requirements" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C1_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C1_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Apply professional managerial skills to design and manage an effective IS organization by understanding conceptual skills for abstract thinking and creative solutions, understanding interpersonal skills for leading teams and workgroups, and applying management skills including planning, communicating, problem-solving, delegating, and making decisions." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C1_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C1_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Apply professional managerial skills to design and manage an effective IS organization" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C2_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C2_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Ensure operational efficiency and effectiveness in service delivery of organizational information by evaluating an enterprise’s capability to deliver IT services cost-efficiently with high quality, and evaluating best operating practices for resource optimization in delivering organizational IT strategic goals." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C2_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C2_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Ensure operational efficiency and effectiveness in service delivery of organizational information" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C3_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C3_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Manage the information resources in coordination with line management by applying information management techniques to add value to products and services utilizing appropriate organizational data, creating policies and practices for the use of information resources, and creating appropriate technological solutions for increasing competitive advantages in alignment with enterprise strategic goals." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C3_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C3_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Manage the information resources in coordination with line management" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C4_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C4_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Create and manage the oversight mechanisms by which an organization evaluates, directs, and monitors organizational information technology - managing decision rights and organizational information technology decision-making practices by applying administrative oversight and accountability best practices, decision rights and decision-making practices, and evaluating and monitoring techniques for IT operations." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C4_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C4_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Create and manage the oversight mechanisms by which an organization evaluates, directs, and monitors organizational information technology - managing decision rights and organizational information technology decision-making practices" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C5_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C5_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Implement strategic plans that have been created for the delivery and use of organizational information systems by understanding the systematic process for creating long-range plans for IS to meet the organization's overall strategic plan, understanding the sequence of steps in planning, designing, and communicating the IS strategic plans, and applying methodologies, techniques, and tools used in applying strategic planning." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C5_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C5_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Implement strategic plans that have been created for the delivery and use of organizational information systems" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C6_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C6_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Ensure organizational information systems comply with policies, applicable laws, and regulations by evaluating regulatory standards and regulations such as ISO, Sarbanes-Oxley Act (SOX), COBIT, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, and GDPR." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C6_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C6_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Ensure organizational information systems comply with policies, applicable laws, and regulations" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C7_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C7_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Manage organizational risk and develop risk mitigation plans by understanding potential threats, vulnerabilities, and risks associated with an information technology system, understanding controls for reducing or eliminating risk, evaluating risk management by identifying and assessing risk, and evaluating risk mitigation by taking steps to reduce risk to an acceptable level." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C7_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C7_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Manage organizational risk and develop risk mitigation plans" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C8_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C8_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Create IT procurement policies and understand and negotiate IT contracts by remembering procurement processes and confidentiality, applying delegation of purchasing authority levels, applying bids, proposals and RFP forms and processes, analyzing non-disclosure agreements (NDA), and creating specifications and requirements, and maintenance and support contracts." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C8_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C8_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Create IT procurement policies and understand and negotiate IT contracts" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C9_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C9_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Develop plans for workforce development, training, talent acquisition, and employee retention by applying talent acquisition techniques for defining, identifying, and attracting appropriate IT skills and dispositions, applying workforce development and training methods, and applying IT talent retention strategies for creating policies for salaries and benefits, providing appropriate career path development, and matching employee skills with organizational needs." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.2_C9_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.2_C9_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Develop plans for workforce development, training, talent acquisition, and employee retention" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C1_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C1_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Articulate and critically reflect on the unique features that an application of emerging technology may offer by remembering emerging digital technology areas, applying methods to learn about emerging technology areas, and applying methods to articulate and critically reflect offerings of a particular new digital technology." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C1_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C1_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Articulate and critically reflect on the unique features that an application of emerging technology may offer" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C2_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C2_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Demonstrate knowledge of the role of digital business technologies in social and mobile domains by evaluating social applications of technology, mobile applications of technology, and business applications of technology." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C2_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C2_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Demonstrate knowledge of the role of digital business technologies in social and mobile domains" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C3_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C3_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify and critique characteristics necessary for digital innovation by evaluating conditions for digital innovation, domains of digital innovation, and applications of digital innovations." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C3_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C3_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Identify and critique characteristics necessary for digital innovation" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C4_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C4_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify and validate an opportunity to develop a new digital business model by evaluating digital business models, digital business innovation elements, criteria necessary for new digital business models, and validation criteria for a new digital business model." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C4_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C4_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
                       :string "Identify and validate an opportunity to develop a new digital business model" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C5_Description
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C5_Description rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Identify and evaluate key issues related to implementation and infrastructure issues by evaluating implementation criteria (Scrum or SDLC), creating infrastructure elements for implementation, and evaluating key criteria for continuing or stopping implementation." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/edeyson/ontologies/2024/CCO#LS_IS_A3.5.3_C5_Title
:LS_IS_A3.5.3_C5_Title rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :LangString ;
                       :language "en" ;
