                                      :LangString ;
                             :language "en" ;
                             :string "Utilize tools for testing (unit, integration, acceptance) by understanding systems for identifying and tracking software defects, integration with version control systems and features management, linked and integrative testing, regression testing, and applying familiarity with at least one unit testing library or harness." .


